{"status":true,"data":{"id":314,"name":"Sons of the Furrest","slug":"sons-of-the-furrest","mod_id":"SonsOfTheFurrest","shortDescription":"Turns players into anthropomorphic animals.","description":"Sons of the FURRest? Get it?\nYeah me neither.\n\nTurns all players into furry/anthro characters. There are currently 5 species:\n- Border Collie\n- Red Fox\n- Arctic Fox\n- Canadian Lynx\n- Whitetail Deer\n\nLike with my last mods, I haven't tested on the latest version. Should work in multiplayer, at least it worked for me. Also seems to work in singleplayer I think.\n\nIt is compatible with the Race Selector mod, since my mod does some retarded checksum every 30 seconds to see if any races are updated. You can also press F3 to manually refresh every player's species model.","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":"client","isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":true,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":168,"downloads":359,"latestVersion":"1.2.0","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":2,"commentsCount":6,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166787511_furrest1.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2026-09-24T02:16:59.779Z","createdAt":"2026-09-11T22:46:30.368Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:30:00.549Z","userId":3819,"categoryId":2,"images":[{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166787936_tfur5.jpg"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166788293_tfur4.jpg"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166788438_tfur3.jpg"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166788577_tfur2.jpg"},{"url":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1789166788718_tfur1.jpg"}],"user":{"name":"AKM","slug":"akm","imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1790458504827_3819_avatar.jpg","isTrusted":false},"category":{"name":"Model Swap","slug":"model-swap"},"versions":[{"id":715,"version":"1.2.0","isLatest":true,"changelog":"Fixed aiming guns and other things... hopefully..."